{"overview":"Puberty Syndrome—a rumored, mysterious syndrome that only affects those in their puberty. For example, a bunny girl suddenly appeared in front of Sakuta Azusagawa. The bunny girl's real identity is Mai Sakurajima, a teenage celebrity who is currently an inactive high school senior. For some reason, her charming figure does not reflect in the eyes of others. In the course of revealing the mystery behind this phenomenon, Sakuta begins to explore his feelings towards Mai. Set in a city where the skies and seas shine, Sakuta unfolds the meaning behind his bizarre encounters on women with the said syndrome.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":5,"y":2018,"poster":"/sAxtUBZEL1Eni978DxxEfXQoBTa.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2018,"poster":"/wknxuuUmNQ3zqVVJBQ7aCtUuZ6z.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":2025,"poster":"/ce56jplr0r7pTZl3Rn4uXn18r9u.jpg"}],"episodes":26,"crew":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"石川界人","role":"Sakuta Azusagawa (voice)","photo":"/fzjIkotjUHHs3wgftM9tqdsG8ph.jpg"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Mai Sakurajima (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg"},{"name":"雨宮天","role":"Uzuki Hirokawa (voice)","photo":"/AouA1SfwEazdSSj8rUS9K1WIF4H.jpg"},{"name":"نائو تیاما","role":"Tomoe Koga (voice)","photo":"/6WJDd1z946yFfZBgpC7dWi0FyQw.jpg"},{"name":"آتسومی تانه‌زاکی","role":"Rio Futaba (voice)","photo":"/6tM8GU7QvrdUCvR4kxqVUZivtvO.jpg"},{"name":"山根綺","role":"Ikumi Akagi (voice)","photo":"/va0XORY6VchoceyqywJ4KxsVN5s.jpg"},{"name":"مایا اوچیدا","role":"Nodoka Toyohama (voice)","photo":"/lrcxZXkIgHU55dMs8C4DKkUohqJ.jpg"},{"name":"小原好美","role":"Sara Himeji (voice)","photo":"/3wjTzpJpBiTkLexdMmo9a3wfgRT.jpg"},{"name":"久保ユリカ","role":"Kaede Azusagawa (voice)","photo":"/tpzwj1J6HRq2H6xZjM5Irg7FzT2.jpg"},{"name":"ماناکا ایوامی","role":"Miori Mito (voice)","photo":"/leKMaCBswXG8u4mfQNQ7J3y6Xow.jpg"},{"name":"水瀬いのり","role":"Shoko Makinohara (voice)","pho